# Build context allowlist: local keys, configuration, worlds, reports, and
# diagnostics never enter the Docker build context.
**
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!src/dreamland/
!src/dreamland/**
!deploy/
!deploy/Dockerfile
!deploy/requirements-runtime.txt
!deploy/requirements-build.txt

# Exclude local/interpreter artifacts even below the allowed package tree.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.DS_Store
